revolutionaries-solgov-announcement =
    We have detected several waves of rebellion across our space and are working together with the URSAL to push these radicals back.

    Your sector is not a priority for us, so we are sending a force still in training to assist you. An evacuation shuttle has been dispatched and cannot be recalled.

    Good luck.

